<h2 id="zombie-healing">Zombie Runner Healing &amp; Auto-Reconciliation</h2>
<p>
  If an ephemeral runner machine is stopped abruptly mid-job (e.g. during
  workstation sleep or <code>make stop</code>), GitHub might mark it as <code
    >offline</code
  > but <code>busy: true</code>.
</p>
<p>
  RunZero's autoscaler automatically reconciles zombie runners by cancelling
  stranded runs and unsticking GitHub's runner queue so jobs never hang.
</p>
